## THE LANE (one seat, one branch, one commit)
You build in this order and commit ONCE: (1) pins and clone; (2) PRIOR WORK and baselines at the unmodified base; (3) the absence proof at base, by program, with controls; (4) the edit (a) alone, then the red-proof of the fixture, then (b); (5) neighbours; (6) the plain verify; (7) ONE commit of exactly two paths. A red commit is never made or pushed.
**Done when (exactly this):** (a) `git diff --name-only <main sha>..HEAD` equals exactly `__tests__/fixtures/rd200-js-brand-debt.json` and `static/js/index.js`; (b) `git diff --numstat <main sha>..HEAD` prints `0 82 static/js/index.js` and `2 2 __tests__/fixtures/rd200-js-brand-debt.json` (columns tab-separated), and NOTHING for `backend static/css static/*.html scripts .github package.json package-lock.json` or any other path; (c) by program (python3 -I): the head's `index.js` equals the base's with lines 9223-9264 and 9421-9460 dropped, byte for byte (control: dropping 9222-9263 instead compares unequal), and the head's fixture parses to the base's object with exactly the two `count` values 6 -> 5 changed (control: a copy with a third change is reported); (d) the absence proof of Step 3 re-run at the HEAD reads 0 occurrences of both names in the whole clone except `HISTORY.md` prose (control: the base reads the definition lines), and the head's `index.js` parses (`node --check` rc 0 AND an acorn script-mode parse, with a planted syntax error in a scratch copy failing both); (e) the rd200 file reads at base `Tests: 9 passed, 9 total` (or its measured total), under (a) alone `NO ROT` RED naming exactly `index.js #27ae60: manifest 6, found 5` and `index.js #f39c12: manifest 6, found 5` and every other cell green, and under (a)+(b) all green with the printed debt total 142 (from 144); (f) every neighbour of Step 2.3 keeps its `Tests:` line; (g) the plain verify at the head reads `VERDICT: PASS` with `tests=5223 suites=310`, equal to the counts file at the head (untouched, blob `38c0ae66`) and to main's; (h) no `.only/.skip/.todo/xit`, no retry, no new `test(`/`describe`; (i) STATUS says plainly "CodeQL closure and new-alert result UNMEASURED (CodeQL is not runnable here; the PR analysis decides)" and "this branch deploys nothing; the merge starts a Deploy demo run that skips while CI_DEPLOY_ENABLED is unset (read <time>)".

